<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-MARBELLA FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MARBELLA FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARBELLA, Spain 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the Marbella men's tennis tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Gilbert Schaller (Austria) 2-6 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Jordi Burillo (Spain) beat Hicham Arazi (Morocco) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Fernando Vicente (Spain) beat Roberto Carretero (Spain) 6-0 6-4</p>
<p>Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Albert Portas (Spain) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Kevin Goellner (Germany) beat Tomas Carbonell (Spain) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Francisco Clavet (Spain) beat Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) 6-3 7-6 (7-2).</p>
</text>
